Delegates do not merely negotiate coexistence between party executives. They
create a new membership, elect a common authority and make every participating
organisation one current among several. Razem, where present, is fully inside
the party rather than attached to it; SLD's legal shell may carry the registry
entry, but it does not by itself decide who governs.

- @poland_event_queue: Open the new chapter


