Common-list, primary, finance and arbitration rules are written without
pretending that separate legal parties have vanished. Razem, SLD and Wiosna
retain their own memberships wherever they still exist. None is an outsider to
the federation, and none can call its private machinery the whole Left. That
legal form also fixes the electoral risk: the federation must begin on an
**8% coalition committee** and cannot use a 5% party list while it remains a
federation.

- @federation_joint_convention: Allocate the federation's first leadership


@federation_joint_convention
# prose-audit: Grade A — The convention turns a generic federation into a concrete choice among rotating legitimacy, membership-weighted command and portfolio autonomy, with a distinct cost attached to each.
title: The joint convention allocates federal leadership
subtitle: A common chair can act quickly; a plural presidium can recruit and specialise without erasing its parties.
face-image: img/poland/events/left-congress-hall.webp
new-page: true

= September 2020 — Who may speak for a federation?

The compact created a federal council, not a single party executive. SLD,
Wiosna, Razem and the smaller organisations now have to decide who chairs the
joint campaign, who speaks between council meetings and which decisions still
require a member-party mandate.

- @federation_rotating_presidium
- @federation_weighted_council
- @federation_portfolio_council


@federation_rotating_presidium
title: Rotate the joint chair between member parties
subtitle: Protected identity and broad legitimacy; handovers slow decisions and blur the national face.
on-arrival: federation_sequence_stage = 2; federation_leadership_model = "Rotating member-party presidium"; federation_route_score += 2; federation_decision_delay += 2; federation_brand_dilution += 2; party_unity += 2; public_trust += 1; media_capacity -= 2; news_headline = "The Left federation gives every member party a turn in the chair"
go-to: federation_finance_convention


@federation_weighted_council
title: Weight the council by each party's membership and seats
subtitle: A clearer lead party and faster decisions; smaller partners gain a reason to use their vetoes.
on-arrival: federation_sequence_stage = 2; federation_leadership_model = "Weighted federal council"; federation_route_score += 0; federation_veto_pressure += 2; federation_decision_delay += 1; media_capacity += 2; party_unity -= 2; pps_dissent += 4; progressives_dissent += 3; news_headline = "The largest Left party receives the strongest federal voice"
go-to: federation_finance_convention


@federation_portfolio_council
title: Give each party a policy and regional portfolio
subtitle: Local specialisation and coalition reach; no chair can promise across another party's brief.
on-arrival: federation_sequence_stage = 2; federation_leadership_model = "Portfolio federal council"; federation_route_score += 3; federation_veto_pressure += 1; federation_decision_delay += 1; local_network += 3; organiser_energy += 2; labor_credibility += 2; movement_autonomy += 2; party_unity -= 1; news_headline = "Federal parties divide policy and regional portfolios"
go-to: federation_finance_convention


@federation_finance_convention
title: One campaign, several balance sheets
subtitle: The federation must share assets and campaign money without quietly transferring legal ownership.
new-page: true

SLD holds offices and leases, Wiosna has media and candidate networks, and
Razem has dues-paying organisation. A common campaign needs money now. The
formula will decide whether resources follow the federation or remain tools of
the parties that brought them.

- @federation_common_treasury
- @federation_matching_grants
- @federation_host_assets


@federation_common_treasury
title: Pay into an audited common campaign treasury
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Strong common capacity; every contributor surrenders some private control.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: An audited treasury needs one resource to establish.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; federation_sequence_stage = 3; federation_finance_model = "Audited common treasury"; federation_route_score += 3; turnout_readiness += 4; public_trust += 2; barons_dissent += 3; razem_dissent += 2; news_headline = "The federal Left pools campaign money under an independent audit"

The parties deposit a fixed share of dues and subvention into a joint account.
The auditor publishes every transfer. The campaign can now buy nationally,
but no treasurer can redirect the money to rescue a weak home organisation.

- @poland_event_queue: Open the federal chapter


@federation_matching_grants
title: Match each party's local campaign spending
subtitle: Strong local specialisation; duplicated approvals cost speed and a common brand.
on-arrival: federation_sequence_stage = 3; federation_finance_model = "Matched member-party budgets"; federation_route_score += 1; federation_veto_pressure += 1; federation_decision_delay += 1; federation_brand_dilution += 1; local_network += 3; organiser_energy += 3; media_capacity -= 1; news_headline = "Federal matching grants keep campaign money close to local parties"

The council matches verified local spending instead of owning every account.
County organisers can specialise and recruit under the label people know. A
poster, transfer or emergency hire now needs two approvals instead of one.

- @poland_event_queue: Open the federal chapter


@federation_host_assets
title: Let the SLD successor host the common assets
subtitle: +2 resources and immediate capacity; the neutral federation begins to look like one party's brand.
view-if: merger_barons_present = 1
on-arrival: resources += 2; federation_sequence_stage = 3; federation_finance_model = "SLD-hosted federal assets"; federation_route_score -= 2; federation_veto_pressure += 2; federation_brand_dilution += 3; local_network += 4; barons_dissent -= 4; spring_dissent += 6; razem_dissent += 6; party_unity -= 4; news_headline = "The SLD successor hosts the federation's campaign assets"

The old legal vehicle signs leases and pays invoices, producing capacity the
federation could not otherwise afford. Every partner keeps its legal identity,
but the name on the account and the keys in the office belong to one of them.

- @poland_event_queue: Open the federal chapter


