        ? "Member-ratified Wiosna-led Left"
        : (Q.left_dominant_current === "barons"
            ? "Member-ratified centralised Nowa Lewica"
            : "Member-ratified common Left"));
add("party_unity", 5);
add("progressives_dissent", -4);
add("labor_dissent", -3);
add("barons_dissent", 4);
add("public_trust", 2);
Q.news_headline = "Members ratify the party settlement already in force";
!}

Members debate the constitution clause by clause and ratify the arrangement
negotiated in September. The ballot supplies a stronger source of legitimacy;
it does not transform the phrase “membership ballot” into
a new faction leader. [? if left_dominant_current = "razem": Razem keeps the
chair and gains a member-ratified mandate.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@rename_drive
