!}

Tables appear outside campuses, factories and municipal offices. Their dues
pay the first bills, and the new roll makes old SLD or Wiosna membership lists
less decisive in any future ballot. The political leadership remains what the
constitution says it is; this choice changes who will constitute the party a
year from now.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@rename_machine
