!}

Czarzasty's executive assigns the offices, signatories and regional chairs.
[? if rename_displaced_leader = "Razem": This reverses a Razem-led settlement
from inside the party. Razem loses the chair but remains a merged current; it
is not expelled and does not become a hanger-on merely because the apparatus
has won a counter-coup.?] [? if rename_displaced_leader = "Robert Biedroń":
Wiosna loses political command to the legal machinery it was supposed to
transform.?] [? if rename_displaced_leader = "Membership convention": The
inherited executive replaces member-founded authority with administrative
control.?] [? if rename_displaced_leader = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty": The legal
registration simply confirms the command structure already chosen.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@rename_federation
# prose-audit: Grade B — Keeps the federal case distinct from a party rename, which is the point. Brief, procedural, and resolved in the language of statutes and leases.
title: Register a federation without pretending it is one party
face-image: img/poland/events/left-congress-hall.webp
new-page: true

= March 2021 — A legal name for a federal Left

The federation has common rules but separate memberships. SLD may still
register the Nowa Lewica name for its own legal vehicle, yet that act cannot by
itself absorb Wiosna, Razem or any other partner. We can preserve the federal
compact, ask all members to ratify it, use registration to complete a real
unification or let the old SLD vehicle dominate what was supposed to remain
plural.

- @rename_federal_compact
- @rename_federal_members
- @rename_federal_unify
- @rename_federal_machine
- @rename_federal_separate


@rename_federal_compact
title: Register the legal vehicles and preserve the federal compact
on-arrival: left_mandate = "registered_federal_compact"; left_constitution = "federal_council"; left_machine_controller = "separate"; left_project = "Registered federation of Left parties"; left_party_name = "Lewica"; federation_sequence_stage = 4; left_structural_endpoint = "Registered binding federation"; party_unity += 3; razem_dissent -= 2; barons_dissent += 1; news_headline = "Separate Left parties register a binding federal compact"

Each party retains its officers, property and member roll. The federal council
receives only the powers written into the common agreement: lists, programme,
finance and arbitration. No partner is rhetorically inside while legally being
treated as a guest.

- @federation_candidate_selection: Select a common candidate


@rename_federal_members
title: Ratify the federal compact among every member party
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Requires one resource.
