The federal council still exists, but candidate lists, staff contracts and
campaign accounts now pass through the SLD successor. Wiosna and Razem remain
legally autonomous partners. The problem is not that they are outsiders; it is
that the institution controlling common resources has ceased to behave like a
neutral federal organ.

