@left_revolt_stable
# prose-audit: Grade B — The no-split outcome is well observed — "full of people discovering that other currents can count" — and each dominant-current variant says what surviving actually means. It is a one-paragraph bulletin with no decision.
title: The merger survives its first congress
face-image: img/poland/events/wlodzimierz-czarzasty-2019.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: left_revolt_event_done = 1; merger_resolution = "Stable first congress"; party_unity += 2; public_trust += 1; organiser_energy += 1; news_headline = "The common Left survives its first congress without a revolt"

= July 2021 — An argument that does not become a split

The first congress is loud, procedural and full of people discovering that
other currents can count. Yet the settlement holds. [? if left_dominant_current = "razem": Razem remains the incumbent leadership of the common party, while SLD and Wiosna organise as protected currents inside it.?] [? if left_dominant_current = "barons": The executive retains command without needing a purge.?] [? if left_dominant_current = "spring": Wiosna survives the first test of its leadership.?] [? if left_dominant_current = "members": The member-founded executive proves capable of governing the inherited machinery.?]

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@left_federation_crisis
# prose-audit: Grade A — Earlier leadership, finance, candidate and local-organisation bargains all reach the same crisis; enforcement, peaceful unity, a loose alliance and an orderly successor-party exit are distinct structural outcomes.
title: An electoral and coalition crisis tests the federal compact
face-image: img/poland/events/wlodzimierz-czarzasty-2019.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
function n(value) {
    return Number(value) || 0;
}
Q.left_revolt_event_done = 1;
Q.federation_sequence_stage = Math.max(7, n(Q.federation_sequence_stage));
Q.federation_route_score = Math.max(
    -5,
    Math.min(
        15,
        n(Q.federation_route_score) -
            n(Q.federation_veto_pressure) * 0.5 -
            n(Q.federation_brand_dilution) * 0.35
    )
);
const candidates = [];
const razemHasBureauSeat =
    Number(Q.zandberg_advisor) === 1 ||
    Number(Q.biejat_advisor) === 1 ||
    Number(Q.zawisza_advisor) === 1 ||
    Number(Q.matysiak_advisor) === 1;
if (Number(Q.merger_barons_present) === 1 && Number(Q.czarzasty_advisor) === 1) {
    candidates.push({ name: "Włodzimierz Czarzasty", score: n(Q.barons_strength) });
}
if (Number(Q.merger_spring_present) === 1 && Number(Q.biedron_advisor) === 1) {
    candidates.push({ name: "Robert Biedroń", score: n(Q.spring_strength) });
}
if (Number(Q.merger_razem_present) === 1 && razemHasBureauSeat) {
    candidates.push({ name: "Razem", score: n(Q.razem_strength) });
}
candidates.push({
    name: "Members",
    score: Math.max(n(Q.progressives_strength), n(Q.pps_strength)) +
        n(Q.labor_movement_leverage) * 0.10
});
candidates.sort(function(a, b) { return b.score - a.score; });
Q.federation_revolt_leader = candidates.length ? candidates[0].name : "Members";
Q.news_headline = "The Left federation fights over lists, money and the right to veto";
!}

= July 2021 — One whip, several legal parties

No party can purge another from its own membership, so the crisis moves to the
institutions they actually share: candidate lists, parliamentary discipline,
subvention money and arbitration. The opposition's coalition strategy now
needs an answer while local organisers are already preparing future lists.
[? if federation_route_score >= 4: The earlier federal bargains produced a
usable common candidate rule, money channel and organising map.?][? if
federation_route_score < 4: Delays, vetoes and competing brands have left the
council without enough common authority for a clean response.?] [? if federation_revolt_leader = "Razem":
Razem is the strongest federal partner and demands that the compact be obeyed
without converting its leadership into legal absorption.?] [? if
federation_revolt_leader = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty": The SLD successor controls
the largest machine and argues that coordination requires a real centre.?]
[? if federation_revolt_leader = "Robert Biedroń": Wiosna claims the public
mandate to lead a federation whose old machinery still sits elsewhere.?]

- @federation_enforce
- @federation_unify
- @federation_loosen
- @federation_exit


@federation_enforce
title: Enforce the federal compact exactly as written
on-arrival: {!
Q.merger_resolution = "Federal compact enforced";
Q.left_constitution = "federal_council";
Q.left_machine_controller = "separate";
Q.left_mandate = "federal_arbitration";
Q.federation_crisis_result = "Binding federation survived its first electoral crisis";
Q.federation_successful = Number(Q.federation_route_score) >= 4 ? 1 : 0;
Q.federation_coalition_reach = Q.federation_successful ? 1 : 0;
Q.left_structural_endpoint = Q.federation_successful
    ? "Successful binding federation"
    : "Binding federation under continuing veto pressure";
Q.party_unity += Q.federation_successful ? 5 : 1;
Q.barons_dissent -= 2;
Q.spring_dissent -= 2;
Q.razem_dissent -= 3;
Q.progressives_dissent -= 2;
Q.labor_dissent -= 2;
Q.local_network += Q.federation_successful ? 3 : 0;
Q.turnout_readiness += Q.federation_successful ? 3 : -1;
Q.negotiation_capital += Q.federation_successful ? 3 : 0;
Q.ko_relation += Q.federation_successful ? 2 : 0;
Q.psl_relation += Q.federation_successful ? 3 : 0;
Q.p2050_relation += Q.federation_successful ? 3 : 0;
Q.news_headline = Q.federation_successful
    ? "Federal arbitration turns specialist parties into a wider coalition channel"
    : "Federal arbitration preserves the parties but not a decisive common response";
!}

The council allocates lists and money under the written formula and sends each
party back to its own internal organs. Nobody wins ownership of the whole Left,
but nobody can ignore the rules merely because it owns more office keys.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@federation_unify
title: Ask federal members to found one political party
subtitle: Cost: 2 resources and at least 50 unity.
choose-if: resources >= 2 and party_unity >= 50
unavailable-subtitle: Requires two resources and 50 party unity.
on-arrival: {!
function add(name, amount) {
    Q[name] = (Number(Q[name]) || 0) + amount;
}
Q.resources = (Number(Q.resources) || 0) - 2;
Q.left_common_party_exists = 1;
Q.left_merger_structure = "unified_party";
Q.left_merger_scope = "all_surviving_currents";
Q.left_legal_vehicle = Q.merger_barons_present
    ? "sld"
    : (Q.merger_spring_present ? "spring" : "new_party");
Q.left_constitution = "single_leadership_protected_currents";
Q.left_mandate = "member_ballot";
Q.federation_successful = 1;
Q.federation_peaceful_unification = 1;
Q.federation_crisis_result = "Federal members peacefully founded one plural party";
Q.left_pluralism_protected = 1;
Q.left_structural_endpoint = "Peaceful plural unification from federation";
Q.barons_merged = Q.merger_barons_present;
Q.spring_merged = Q.merger_spring_present;
Q.razem_merged = Q.merger_razem_present;
Q.barons_org_status = Q.merger_barons_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
Q.spring_org_status = Q.merger_spring_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
Q.razem_org_status = Q.merger_razem_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
Q.pps_org_status = Q.merger_pps_present ? "merged_current" : "outside";
if (Q.federation_revolt_leader === "Razem") {
    Q.merger_leader = "Razem";
    Q.left_dominant_current = "razem";
    Q.left_machine_controller = Q.merger_barons_present ? "shared" : "razem";
    Q.left_party_name = "Lewica Razem";
    Q.left_project = "Federation unified under Razem";
    add("razem_dissent", -7);
    add("barons_dissent", 7);
} else if (Q.federation_revolt_leader === "Włodzimierz Czarzasty") {
    Q.merger_leader = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty";
    Q.left_dominant_current = "barons";
    Q.left_machine_controller = "barons";
    Q.left_party_name = "Nowa Lewica";
    Q.left_project = "Federation unified under the SLD successor";
    add("barons_dissent", -6);
    add("razem_dissent", 8);
} else if (Q.federation_revolt_leader === "Robert Biedroń") {
    Q.merger_leader = "Robert Biedroń";
    Q.left_dominant_current = "spring";
    Q.left_machine_controller = Q.merger_barons_present ? "shared" : "spring";
    Q.left_party_name = Q.merger_barons_present ? "Nowa Lewica" : "Wiosna";
    Q.left_project = "Federation unified under Wiosna";
    add("spring_dissent", -6);
    add("barons_dissent", 6);
} else {
    Q.merger_leader = "Membership convention";
    Q.left_dominant_current = "members";
    Q.left_machine_controller = "shared";
    Q.left_party_name = Q.merger_barons_present ? "Nowa Lewica" : "Lewica";
    Q.left_project = "Federation unified by its members";
    add("progressives_dissent", -4);
    add("labor_dissent", -4);
    add("barons_dissent", 5);
}
Q.merger_resolution = "Federation converted into one party";
add("party_unity", 6);
add("public_trust", 2);
Q.news_headline = "Federal members found a single political party";
!}

The partners submit the question to all participating memberships and accept
the strongest federal mandate as the first leadership. Every party that signs
now actually merges. A Razem-led outcome therefore makes Razem the governing
current of the new party, not a federal guest preserved in the prose after its
legal autonomy has disappeared.

