on-arrival: nowa_lewica_merger_agreed = 0; left_merger_structure = "separate_parties"; left_common_party_exists = 0; left_merger_scope = "none"; left_constitution = "none"; left_machine_controller = "separate"; left_mandate = "electoral_agreement"; left_dominant_current = "none"; merger_leader = "No merger"; merger_resolution = "Federation reduced to electoral alliance"; federation_crisis_result = "Federation reduced to a loose electoral alliance"; federation_successful = 0; federation_coalition_reach = 0; left_structural_endpoint = "Loose electoral alliance after federal crisis"; left_project = "Electoral Left of separate parties"; left_party_name = "Lewica"; barons_org_status = "electoral_partner" if merger_barons_present = 1; spring_org_status = "electoral_partner" if merger_spring_present = 1; razem_org_status = "electoral_partner" if merger_razem_present = 1; party_unity -= 4; news_headline = "The Left abandons federal discipline but preserves its common list"

The parties stop pretending that the council can issue binding internal orders.
They retain a common parliamentary name and negotiate each election anew.

