@left_revolt_live
# prose-audit: Grade B — Five leadership configurations each get their own account of who is challenging whom, which is genuinely hard to do. What follows is procedure: suspensions, ballots and pacts resolved in the language of statutes rather than of the people losing their offices.
title: The merger revolt
face-image: img/poland/events/wlodzimierz-czarzasty-2019.webp
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.left_revolt_event_done = 1;
const selectedLeader = String(Q.merger_leader || "");
const razemHasBureauSeat =
    Q.zandberg_advisor || Q.biejat_advisor ||
    Q.zawisza_advisor || Q.matysiak_advisor;
if (
    selectedLeader === "Razem" &&
    Number(Q.razem_merged) === 1 &&
    razemHasBureauSeat
) {
    Q.merger_revolt_leader = "Razem";
} else if (
    selectedLeader === "Włodzimierz Czarzasty" &&
    Number(Q.czarzasty_advisor) === 1
) {
    Q.merger_revolt_leader = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty";
} else if (
    selectedLeader === "Robert Biedroń" &&
    Number(Q.biedron_advisor) === 1
) {
    Q.merger_revolt_leader = "Robert Biedroń";
} else if (selectedLeader === "Dual chairs") {
    Q.merger_revolt_leader =
        Number(Q.czarzasty_advisor) === 1 &&
        (Number(Q.barons_strength) || 0) >= (Number(Q.spring_strength) || 0)
            ? "Włodzimierz Czarzasty"
            : (Number(Q.biedron_advisor) === 1 ? "Dual chairs" : "Members");
} else {
    Q.merger_revolt_leader = "Members";
}

if (Q.merger_revolt_leader === "Razem") {
    Q.merger_revolt_challenger = Number(Q.merger_barons_present) === 1
        ? "SLD apparatus"
        : (Number(Q.merger_spring_present) === 1 ? "Wiosna current" : "internal opposition");
} else if (Q.merger_revolt_leader === "Włodzimierz Czarzasty") {
    Q.merger_revolt_challenger = "reform coalition";
} else if (Q.merger_revolt_leader === "Robert Biedroń") {
    Q.merger_revolt_challenger = Number(Q.merger_barons_present) === 1
        ? "SLD apparatus"
        : "member opposition";
} else if (Q.merger_revolt_leader === "Dual chairs") {
    Q.merger_revolt_challenger = "member opposition";
} else {
    Q.merger_revolt_challenger = Number(Q.merger_barons_present) === 1
        ? "SLD apparatus"
        : "inherited organisations";
}

Q.news_headline = Q.merger_revolt_leader === "Razem"
    ? "The old apparatus revolts against Razem's party leadership"
    : (Q.merger_revolt_leader === "Włodzimierz Czarzasty"
        ? "Nowa Lewica's merger dispute becomes a parliamentary revolt"
        : (Q.merger_revolt_leader === "Robert Biedroń"
            ? "The inherited machine challenges Wiosna's leadership"
            : "The merger's unresolved authority produces a parliamentary revolt"));
!}

= July 2021 — The merger revolt

The common party has a name, statutes and several organisations that remember
when their own keys opened every door. Parliamentary offices, regional lists
and the membership register turn a constitutional disagreement into a fight
over who can issue binding orders.

[? if merger_revolt_leader = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty": Internal opponents
challenge Czarzasty's control. The executive can purge them, negotiate a
protected-current truce, submit to a ballot or surrender to a still older SLD
restoration.?] [? if merger_revolt_leader = "Robert Biedroń": Wiosna leads the
party, while the inherited apparatus claims that public branding cannot govern
regional machinery.?] [? if merger_revolt_leader = "Razem": Razem is the
incumbent leadership of a party into which it actually merged. SLD and Wiosna
figures are the internal challengers. Razem can enforce its mandate, share
appointments, risk a membership ballot or dissolve the party back into a
federation.?] [? if merger_revolt_leader = "Dual chairs": Neither protected
chair can command alone. Parity can be preserved, replaced by members or
captured by one apparatus.?] [? if merger_revolt_leader = "Members": A
member-founded executive confronts inherited organisations that still control
many offices and nominations.?]

