@revolt_restore_miller
title: Back the anti-merger old-guard restoration
subtitle: Below 45 unity, collapse alone opens restoration; at 45–50 it also needs a PPS revolt, and forcing it above 45 creates additional backlash. Miller is locked into slot 1.
choose-if: miller_restoration_available_2021 = 1
unavailable-subtitle: Requires a non-federal common party, merged SLD machinery, active PPS inside it, and either unity below 45 or unity at 45–50 with PPS at 55 dissent or escalation stage 2. Miller must not already be restored.
on-arrival: {!
function add(name, amount) {
    Q[name] = (Number(Q[name]) || 0) + amount;
}
const forcedRestoration = Number(Q.party_unity) > 45;
const forceBacklash = forcedRestoration ? 4 : 0;
Q.merger_resolution = "SLD restoration under Miller";
Q.miller_restoration_done = 1;
Q.old_left_route_state = "miller_restoration";
Q.pps_democratic_split_done = 1;
Q.left_revolt_event_done = 1;
Q.miller_advisor = 1;
Q.advisor_slot_1_locked = 1;
Q.advisor_slot_1 = "miller";
Q.advisor_slot_1_lock_reason = "Old SLD restoration";

const currentAdvisors = [
    "miller",
    "czarzasty",
    "biedron",
    "zandberg",
    "dziemianowicz_bak",
    "zukowska",
    "kotula",
    "biejat",
    "wieczorek",
    "gawkowski",
    "nowicka",
    "zawisza",
    "matysiak"
];
const demotionOrder = [
    "zandberg",
    "biejat",
    "zawisza",
    "matysiak",
    "biedron",
    "dziemianowicz_bak",
    "zukowska",
    "kotula",
    "gawkowski",
    "nowicka",
    "wieczorek",
    "czarzasty"
];
function countAdvisors() {
    return currentAdvisors.reduce(function(total, advisor) {
        return total + (Number(Q[advisor + "_advisor"]) === 1 ? 1 : 0);
    }, 0);
}
while (countAdvisors() > 3) {
    const toRemove = demotionOrder.find(function(advisor) {
        return Number(Q[advisor + "_advisor"]) === 1;
    });
    if (!toRemove) {
        break;
    }
    Q[toRemove + "_advisor"] = 0;
}
const remainingAdvisors = currentAdvisors.filter(function(advisor) {
    return advisor !== "miller" && Number(Q[advisor + "_advisor"]) === 1;
});
Q.n_advisors = countAdvisors();
Q.advisor_slot_2 = remainingAdvisors[0] || "";
Q.advisor_slot_3 = remainingAdvisors[1] || "";

Q.merger_leader = "Leszek Miller";
Q.left_dominant_current = "barons";
Q.left_machine_controller = "barons";
Q.left_mandate = "executive_coup";
Q.left_constitution = "single_leadership";
Q.left_party_name = "Nowa Lewica";
Q.barons_org_status = "merged_current";
Q.pps_org_status = "merged_current";
Q.pps_demand_answered = 1;
Q.pps_escalation_stage = 0;
Q.pps_last_crisis_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
if (Number(Q.razem_merged) === 1) {
    Q.razem_org_status = "merged_current";
}
if (Number(Q.spring_merged) === 1) {
    Q.spring_org_status = "merged_current";
}
add("barons_strength", 10);
add("barons_dissent", -10);
add("spring_dissent", 8 + forceBacklash);
add("labor_dissent", 4 + forceBacklash);
add("progressives_dissent", 8 + forceBacklash);
add("razem_dissent", (Number(Q.razem_merged) === 1 ? 15 : 10) + forceBacklash);
add("pps_dissent", -15);
add("party_unity", -12 - forceBacklash);
add("public_trust", -5 - (forcedRestoration ? 2 : 0));
Q.left_project = "Old SLD restoration in Nowa Lewica";
Q.left_leader = "Leszek Miller and the old SLD establishment";
Q.left_leadership_result = "Merger revolt restored old-SLD command";
Q.news_headline = forcedRestoration
    ? "The old guard forces Miller's restoration through a divided party"
    : "The anti-merger revolt restores Miller and old-SLD command";
!}

PPS dissidents give the rebellion a socialist lineage; SLD regional officials
supply the offices, membership records and nomination machinery. The old guard
wins control in one night of procedural votes. [? if razem_merged: Razem loses
the leadership but remains a merged current trapped inside the party it helped
create. A later split may follow, but this event does not pretend that Razem
was merely an outside affiliate all along.?] Wiosna and the younger currents
receive the same blunt message: the merger has been captured by the
organisation it was supposed to replace.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@revolt_dissolve
title: Dissolve the common party into a federation
subtitle: Every current regains legal autonomy; common lists and arbitration survive.
on-arrival: {!
function add(name, amount) {
    Q[name] = (Number(Q[name]) || 0) + amount;
}
Q.merger_resolution = "Unified party dissolved into federation";
Q.left_common_party_exists = 0;
Q.left_merger_structure = "federation";
Q.left_merger_scope = "all_surviving_currents";
Q.left_legal_vehicle = "separate_parties";
Q.left_constitution = "federal_council";
Q.left_machine_controller = "separate";
Q.left_mandate = "negotiated_federal_compact";
Q.left_dominant_current = "none";
Q.merger_leader = "Federal council";
Q.left_project = "Federated Left after merger crisis";
Q.left_party_name = "Lewica";
Q.barons_merged = 0;
Q.spring_merged = 0;
Q.razem_merged = 0;
Q.barons_org_status = Q.merger_barons_present ? "federal_partner" : "outside";
Q.spring_org_status = Q.merger_spring_present ? "federal_partner" : "outside";
Q.razem_org_status = Q.merger_razem_present ? "federal_partner" : "outside";
Q.pps_org_status = Q.merger_pps_present ? "federal_partner" : "outside";
add("party_unity", -4);
add("barons_dissent", -4);
add("spring_dissent", -4);
add("razem_dissent", -5);
add("progressives_dissent", -2);
add("labor_dissent", -2);
Q.news_headline = "The merged party dissolves into a federal Left";
!}

The common statute is wound down before one current can use it to expel the
others. Each organisation regains legal autonomy, while a federal council
keeps common lists, finance rules and parliamentary arbitration. Razem ceases
to be a merged current because the party itself has been dissolved—not because
later prose forgot which settlement was chosen.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@revolt_razem_enforce
title: Enforce Razem's constituent mandate
subtitle: Razem keeps command and takes direct control of the common machinery.
view-if: merger_revolt_leader = "Razem"
on-arrival: {!
Q.merger_resolution = "Razem discipline";
Q.merger_leader = "Razem";
Q.left_dominant_current = "razem";
Q.left_machine_controller = "razem";
Q.left_mandate = "constituent_enforced";
Q.left_constitution = "razem_dual_chairs";
Q.left_project = "Disciplined Razem-led Left";
Q.left_party_name = "Lewica Razem";
Q.left_leader = Q.razem_leader + " and " + Q.razem_co_leader;
Q.left_leadership_result =
    "Razem co-chairs enforce their constituent mandate";
Q.razem_org_status = "merged_current";
Q.razem_dissent -= 8;
Q.razem_strength += 3;
Q.party_unity -= 10;
Q.barons_dissent += 12;
Q.spring_dissent += 7;
Q.public_trust -= 3;
Q.news_headline =
    "Razem defeats the apparatus rebellion and takes control of the party machinery";
!}

Razem answers with the statute under which every organisation merged. It
replaces hostile signatories, appoints regional commissioners and makes the
common executive—not the old SLD offices—the final authority. The party becomes
easier to command and harder for defeated currents to consent to.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@revolt_razem_pact
title: Guarantee every defeated current a protected place
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Razem leads, while appointments and appeals become plural.
view-if: merger_revolt_leader = "Razem"
choose-if: resources >= 1 and faction_vetoes <= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Requires one resource and no multi-caucus veto.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.merger_resolution = "Razem-led current pact";
Q.merger_leader = "Razem";
Q.left_dominant_current = "razem";
Q.left_machine_controller = "shared";
Q.left_mandate = "negotiated_truce";
Q.left_constitution = "razem_dual_chairs";
Q.left_project = "Razem-led Left with protected currents";
Q.left_party_name = "Lewica Razem";
Q.left_leader = Q.razem_leader + " and " + Q.razem_co_leader;
Q.left_leadership_result =
    "Razem co-chairs lead under a protected-current pact";
Q.razem_org_status = "merged_current";
Q.party_unity += 7;
Q.razem_dissent -= 4;
Q.barons_dissent -= 6;
Q.spring_dissent -= 5;
Q.labor_dissent -= 3;
Q.progressives_dissent -= 3;
Q.news_headline =
    "Razem secures its leadership by protecting every merged current";
!}

Razem's two chairs stay in office. SLD, Wiosna and the smaller currents receive guaranteed
appointments, nomination shares and appeal panels inside the party. They stop
boycotting a structure in which they can now see their own continued existence.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@revolt_razem_ballot
title: Put Razem's leadership back to the full membership
view-if: merger_revolt_leader = "Razem"
on-arrival: merger_ballot_origin = "Razem confidence vote"; merger_resolution = "Membership ballot called"; news_headline = "Members decide whether Razem keeps the merged party"
go-to: revolt_ballot_count


@revolt_ballot_count
title: Count the membership ballot
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
function n(value) {
    return Math.max(0, Number(value) || 0);
}
function penalty(value) {
    return Math.max(0, n(value)) * 0.35;
}
const incumbent = String(Q.merger_revolt_leader || "Members");
const candidates = [];
const razemHasBureauSeat =
    Number(Q.zandberg_advisor) === 1 ||
    Number(Q.biejat_advisor) === 1 ||
    Number(Q.zawisza_advisor) === 1 ||
    Number(Q.matysiak_advisor) === 1;

if (
    Q.barons_org_status === "merged_current" &&
    Number(Q.czarzasty_advisor) === 1
) {
    candidates.push({
        name: "Włodzimierz Czarzasty",
        score: n(Q.barons_strength) - penalty(Q.barons_dissent) +
            (Q.left_machine_controller === "barons" ? 5 : 0) +
            (incumbent === "Włodzimierz Czarzasty" ? 7.25 : 0)
    });
}
if (
    Q.spring_org_status === "merged_current" &&
    Number(Q.biedron_advisor) === 1
) {
    candidates.push({
        name: "Robert Biedroń",
        score: n(Q.spring_strength) - penalty(Q.spring_dissent) +
            (Q.left_machine_controller === "spring" ? 4 : 0) +
            (incumbent === "Robert Biedroń" || incumbent === "Dual chairs" ? 7.25 : 0)
    });
}
if (
    Q.razem_org_status === "merged_current" &&
    Number(Q.razem_merged) === 1 &&
    razemHasBureauSeat
) {
    candidates.push({
        name: "Razem",
        score: n(Q.razem_strength) - penalty(Q.razem_dissent) +
            (Q.left_machine_controller === "razem" ? 4 : 0) +
            (incumbent === "Razem" ? 7.25 : 0)
    });
}
const memberCurrents = [
    n(Q.progressives_strength),
    n(Q.pps_strength),
    n(Q.social_patriot_strength)
].sort(function(a, b) { return b - a; });
const memberScore =
    memberCurrents[0] +
    memberCurrents[1] * 0.25 +
    memberCurrents[2] * 0.15 +
    n(Q.labor_movement_leverage) * 0.10 +
    (Q.left_mandate === "member_ballot" ? 6 : 0) +
    (incumbent === "Members" ? 7.25 : 0);
candidates.push({ name: "Members", score: memberScore });

candidates.sort(function(a, b) { return b.score - a.score; });
Q.merger_ballot_winner = candidates.length ? candidates[0].name : "Members";
Q.merger_ballot_margin = candidates.length > 1
    ? candidates[0].score - candidates[1].score
    : candidates[0].score;
Q.left_mandate = "member_ballot";
Q.party_unity = (Number(Q.party_unity) || 0) + 3;
Q.public_trust = (Number(Q.public_trust) || 0) + 3;
Q.organiser_energy = (Number(Q.organiser_energy) || 0) + 2;
!}
go-to: revolt_ballot_razem if merger_ballot_winner = "Razem"; revolt_ballot_barons if merger_ballot_winner = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty"; revolt_ballot_spring if merger_ballot_winner = "Robert Biedroń"; revolt_ballot_members if merger_ballot_winner = "Members"


@revolt_ballot_razem
title: Razem wins the membership ballot
new-page: true
on-arrival: {!
Q.merger_resolution = "Razem won membership ballot";
Q.merger_leader = "Razem";
Q.left_dominant_current = "razem";
Q.left_machine_controller = "shared";
Q.left_constitution = "razem_dual_chairs";
Q.left_project = "Member-ratified Razem-led Left";
Q.left_party_name = "Lewica Razem";
Q.left_leader = Q.razem_leader + " and " + Q.razem_co_leader;
Q.razem_org_status = "merged_current";
Q.razem_dissent -= 8;
Q.razem_strength += 2;
Q.barons_dissent += 5;
Q.spring_dissent += 2;
Q.left_leadership_result =
    "Razem co-chairs won the merged party membership";
Q.news_headline =
    "Razem wins a full membership mandate over the merged Left";
!}

Razem wins not merely among its original members but across the common party.
The result settles the question the apparatus raised: its co-chairs govern because
the merged membership chose it. SLD and Wiosna remain internal currents with
protected rights, not co-owners entitled to treat the winner as a visitor.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@revolt_ballot_barons
title: Czarzasty's current wins the membership ballot
new-page: true
on-arrival: merger_resolution = "Czarzasty won membership ballot"; merger_leader = "Włodzimierz Czarzasty"; left_dominant_current = "barons"; left_machine_controller = "barons"; left_constitution = "single_leadership_protected_currents"; left_project = "Member-ratified centralised Nowa Lewica"; left_party_name = "Nowa Lewica"; barons_dissent -= 8; barons_strength += 2; spring_dissent += 4; razem_dissent += 7; left_leadership_result = "Czarzasty's current won the merged party membership"; news_headline = "Czarzasty converts machine control into a membership mandate"

The old SLD current proves that it can count members as well as offices. It
retains the machinery and now adds an electoral mandate inside the party.
Razem, where merged, remains an opposition current rather than being rewritten
as an external ally.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@revolt_ballot_spring
title: Wiosna wins the membership ballot
new-page: true
on-arrival: merger_resolution = "Biedroń won membership ballot"; merger_leader = "Robert Biedroń"; left_dominant_current = "spring"; left_machine_controller = "shared"; left_constitution = "single_leadership_protected_currents"; left_project = "Member-ratified Wiosna-led Left"; left_party_name = "Nowa Lewica"; spring_dissent -= 8; spring_strength += 2; barons_dissent += 6; razem_dissent += 3; left_leadership_result = "Wiosna won the merged party membership"; news_headline = "Wiosna wins the common party's membership mandate"

Wiosna converts its public brand into authority among the merged membership.
The inherited SLD apparatus must now serve a leadership it failed to dislodge,
while Razem remains whatever the settlement made it: a merged current if it
joined, or a federal partner if it did not.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@revolt_ballot_members
title: A member-led executive wins the ballot
new-page: true
on-arrival: merger_resolution = "Member executive won membership ballot"; merger_leader = "Membership convention"; left_dominant_current = "members"; left_machine_controller = "shared"; left_constitution = "member_executive"; left_project = "Member-governed common Left"; progressives_dissent -= 6; labor_dissent -= 5; barons_dissent += 5; spring_dissent += 2; razem_dissent += 2; left_leadership_result = "Member executive defeated every inherited party command"; news_headline = "The common membership rejects every inherited party command"

No inherited organisation wins the chair. Progressives, labour organisers and
unaligned members assemble an executive whose authority comes from the common
roll. SLD, Wiosna and Razem continue as internal currents wherever they had
actually merged.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue


@pps_democratic_split
# prose-audit: Grade B — PPS remains a small hinge: autonomy, friendly exit, member rule, central discipline and an old-left restoration are distinct organisational settlements.
title: PPS becomes the hinge of the merger revolt
subtitle: One small socialist organisation can legitimate pluralism, separation or an old-left counter-coup.
face-image: img/poland/events/left-congress.webp
new-page: true

= July 2021 — The old name at the hinge

[? if pps_old_left_revolt_2021 = 1: The common party is in severe crisis. PPS
dissidents can still bargain for autonomy or an orderly exit, but Miller's
supporters now offer their historic label to an SLD apparatus strong enough to
take the merger back. A membership settlement and central suppression remain
possible alternatives to the restoration.?]
[? if pps_old_left_revolt_2021 = 0: The merger has survived because its larger
currents accepted a democratic mandate. PPS now argues that this makes an
autonomous socialist organisation possible without bringing the whole Left
down with it.?]

- @pps_associate
- @pps_accept_split
- @pps_membership_settlement
- @revolt_restore_miller
- @pps_crush


@pps_associate
title: Keep PPS as an autonomous associated current
subtitle: PPS retains its identity and parliamentary representation inside the common Left.
on-arrival: pps_democratic_split_done = 1; left_revolt_event_done = 1; merger_resolution = "PPS associated current"; pps_active = 1; pps_in_left = 1; pps_org_status = "associated_current"; pps_party_formed = 0; pps_demand_answered = 1; pps_escalation_stage = 0; pps_last_crisis_time = time; party_unity += 3; pps_dissent -= 7; labor_dissent -= 2; news_headline = "PPS remains an autonomous current inside the common Left"

PPS keeps its name, internal officers and historical rituals while accepting
the common list and leadership rules. No seats move because no organisation
leaves.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue with the unified Left


@pps_accept_split
title: Accept a friendly PPS parliamentary and electoral split
subtitle: Only seats already tracked as PPS-aligned leave the player's party.
on-arrival: {!
Q.pps_democratic_split_done = 1;
Q.left_revolt_event_done = 1;
Q.merger_resolution = "PPS autonomous party after democratic merger";
Q.pps_active = 0;
Q.pps_in_left = 0;
Q.pps_org_status = "departed";
Q.pps_party_formed = 1;
Q.pps_demand_answered = 1;
Q.pps_escalation_stage = 0;
Q.pps_last_crisis_time = Number(Q.time) || 0;
Q.pps_party_name = "PPS";
Q.pps_party_relation = 55;
Q.pps_circle_relation = 55;
const trackedSejmSeats = Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.left_pps_seats) || 0));
const trackedSenateSeats = Math.max(
    0,
    Math.round(Number(Q.left_pps_senate_seats) || 0)
);
const ppsSejmSeats = Math.min(
    trackedSejmSeats,
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.left_seats) || 0))
);
const ppsSenateSeats = Math.min(
    trackedSenateSeats,
    Math.max(0, Math.round(Number(Q.senate_left_seats) || 0))
);
Q.left_seats = Math.max(0, (Number(Q.left_seats) || 0) - ppsSejmSeats);
Q.left_pps_seats = 0;
Q.pps_party_seats = ppsSejmSeats;
Q.senate_left_seats = Math.max(
    0,
    (Number(Q.senate_left_seats) || 0) - ppsSenateSeats
);
Q.senate_independent_seats =
    Math.max(0, Number(Q.senate_independent_seats) || 0) + ppsSenateSeats;
Q.pps_senate_seats = ppsSenateSeats;
Q.left_pps_senate_seats = 0;
Q.pps_exit_strength = Math.max(1, Number(Q.pps_strength) || 2);
Q.pps_defector_names = ppsSejmSeats > 0 || ppsSenateSeats > 0
    ? "PPS-aligned parliamentarians"
    : "PPS organisers";
Q.konieczny_advisor = 0;
Q.kwiatkowski_advisor = 0;
Q.rozenek_in_left = 0;
Q.morawska_stanecka_in_left = 0;
Q.seat_subvention_seats = Q.left_seats;
Q.party_unity = (Number(Q.party_unity) || 0) - 2;
Q.news_headline = "PPS leaves the common party on negotiated terms";
!}

PPS registers its own party and parliamentary route. [? if pps_party_seats > 0:
The PPS-aligned seats already tracked inside the Left move with it and are now
counted separately.?] [? if pps_party_seats = 0: No separately tracked PPS seat
exists, so the split transfers organisers and legal identity rather than
inventing MPs from the general Left total.?] Relations remain workable because
the departure was negotiated rather than disguised as a purge.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue with the remaining Left


@pps_membership_settlement
title: Put PPS protections to the full merged membership
subtitle: A democratic settlement binds the centre as well as the small current.
on-arrival: pps_democratic_split_done = 1; left_revolt_event_done = 1; merger_resolution = "PPS protections ratified by members"; left_mandate = "member_ballot"; left_constitution = "protected_currents"; left_machine_controller = "shared"; pps_active = 1; pps_in_left = 1; pps_org_status = "associated_current"; pps_party_formed = 0; pps_demand_answered = 1; pps_escalation_stage = 0; pps_last_crisis_time = time; party_unity += 7; public_trust += 3; pps_dissent -= 15; labor_dissent -= 3; barons_dissent += 5; news_headline = "Members ratify PPS protections and bind the common executive"

The whole merged membership votes on PPS's right to keep its name, programme
seat and internal appeal. Ratification denies both the small current and the
central executive a private veto: PPS stays, while the protection now rests on
the same democratic mandate as the common party.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue with the member-ratified Left


@pps_crush
title: Refuse autonomy and enforce common-party discipline
on-arrival: pps_democratic_split_done = 1; left_revolt_event_done = 1; merger_resolution = "PPS autonomy suppressed"; left_mandate = "disciplinary"; pps_org_status = "merged_current"; pps_demand_answered = 1; pps_escalation_stage = 3; pps_last_crisis_time = time; pps_dissent += 12; labor_dissent += 4; party_unity -= 6; public_trust -= 2; news_headline = "The common executive blocks a separate PPS route"

The executive refuses separate registration, money and parliamentary branding.
PPS remains inside, but its next dispute begins from the belief that democratic
rules apply only until a small current tries to use them.

- @poland_event_queue: Continue with the unified Left
